Additionally all these classes are available on runtime (after initialization of GDExtensions).

These classes are available since `dump-extension-api` is ran in `Main::start` after the `setup2` (https://github.com/Yarwin/godot/blob/a468c3172430cd377ac6474e810ab6c8adce5098/main/main.cpp#L4156). If they shouldn't be present then they should be included in generated `disabled_classes.gen.h` and not present in ClassDb at all
